            <ArticleTitle>Paravertebral extravasation of contrast medium during lumbar myelography.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>462-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report on paravertebral extravasation of water soluble contrast medium seen during lumbar myelography and/or subsequent post myelogram CT in 10 patients. This is an uncommon feature of lumbar myelography occurring in less than 1% of cases in our experience and which has not been previously documented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
